<sp who="#COR"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Cora.</hi></speaker> <p>Cora.</p></sp><lb/>
<fw type="sig" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#g">Arthur Schnitzler,</hi> Anatol. 2</fw><lb/>
<pb n="18" facs="#f0028"/>
<sp who="#ANA"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Anatol.</hi></speaker> <p>Cora, wir &#x017F;ind im Wald.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#COR"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Cora.</hi></speaker> <p>O &#x2026; im Wald &#x2026; wie &#x017F;chön! Die grünen<lb/>
