<sp who="#COR"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Cora.</hi></speaker> <p>Ich werde die Wahrheit &#x017F;agen.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ANA"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Anatol<supplied>.</supplied></hi></speaker> <p>Du wir&#x017F;t mir alle Fragen wahrheitsgetreu be-<lb/>
