<sp who="#COR"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Cora.</hi></speaker> <p>Ja.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ANA"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Anatol.</hi></speaker> <p>Nun &#x017F;chlafe &#x2026; ruhig &#x017F;chlafen<stage>(zu Max).</stage> Jetzt<lb/>
