<sp who="#GAB"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Gabriele.</hi></speaker> <p>Oh &#x2014;!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ANA"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Anatol.</hi></speaker> <p>Gnädige Frau &#x2026; Das i&#x017F;t nur echt weiblich!<lb/>
