<sp who="#ANA"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Anatol.</hi></speaker> <p>Mir i&#x017F;t &#x017F;ehr feierlich zu Muthe!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MAX"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Max.</hi></speaker> <p>Du will&#x017F;t Dich am Ende mit ihr verloben &#x2014;?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#ANA"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Anatol.</hi></speaker> <p>Oh nein &#x2014; viel feierlicher!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MAX"><speaker><hi rendition="#b">Max.</hi></speaker> <p>Du heirathe&#x017F;t &#x017F;ie morgen? &#x2014;</p></sp><lb/>
